+that runs before the app's own, and not in the source. Each must be seen to cause the finding
+it is named for, or the run exits 2, and bare `--broken` applies all ten (the command lines are
+with the other refuters, under "When a new check reports zero"). Measured on 30 Oct 2026 on the
+finished gate, each arm alone and then all ten, 74 loads each; every run exited 1, with no
+fault and nothing unrefuted:
